    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn before the apocalypse, with only a single computer, how many lives can you save?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/0a28ce6fa6932069273a2d96120bb06b.poster.avif?t=1754295671\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/0a28ce6fa6932069273a2d96120bb06b.webp?t=1754295671\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Stockpiling for the End Times, Striking it Rich \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rebirth grants you new growth points, allowing for fresh strategic planning. Gather rumors from various websites, forums, and casual chats, manipulate the stock market, become a prophet, amass wealth, stockpile food and materials in advance, and connect with stronger allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/18c4dada7c3cea4f03d78b4c7d35b885.poster.avif?t=1754295671\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/18c4dada7c3cea4f03d78b4c7d35b885.webm?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/18c4dada7c3cea4f03d78b4c7d35b885.mp4?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Building a Shelter, Managing Remotely \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use architectural design software to plan your shelter, assigning companions to tasks like construction, exploration, combat, and recruitment. Cultivate crops, develop technology, and maintain the survival of those unruly citizens, gradually creating a new home capable of withstanding the zombie apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/5e7fd60fbc51a77cbb7baaaaac57381c.poster.avif?t=1754295671\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/5e7fd60fbc51a77cbb7baaaaac57381c.webm?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/5e7fd60fbc51a77cbb7baaaaac57381c.mp4?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruiting Allies, Scheduling Tasks \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover potential recruits online\u2014explosive gang heiresses, highly skilled exploration bloggers, construction prodigies, and top-tier scientists. Find ways to connect with them, leveraging your rebirth advantage to make them your employees, organizing schedules to collectively maintain the shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/f9da8fd74bb9faf3ebe27ee311b26f20.poster.avif?t=1754295671\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/f9da8fd74bb9faf3ebe27ee311b26f20.webm?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/f9da8fd74bb9faf3ebe27ee311b26f20.mp4?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collecting Rumors, Sharing Life Stories \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the network across various regions of Phoenix Harbor, using chat software to reach out to those you\u2019ve met online. Rescue them from the tide of zombies or crowds, and through the internet, use the secrets you\u2019ve gathered to uncover each person\u2019s unique story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/6238639bfb723eb661e55d5ddb502aab.poster.avif?t=1754295671\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/6238639bfb723eb661e55d5ddb502aab.webm?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/6238639bfb723eb661e55d5ddb502aab.mp4?t=1754295671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fighting Zombies, Scavenging \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy the right talents to explore precious resources in the perilous wasteland, entering brutal online doomsday auctions and food warehouses guarded by rival factions. Anticipate the arrival of zombie hordes, producing weapons to defend your shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/6b1f364ff87da564e2fa22f98c7973d0.poster.avif?t=1754295671\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319670/extras/6b1f364ff87da564e2fa22f98c7973d0.webp?t=1754295671\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse may spell doom, but this time, life can start anew.</p>",
